    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, my chest has been feeling weird lately. like a heavy burning sensation right in the middle. it mostly happens when i'm walking up the stairs or being active, but it goes away if i just sit down for a bit. i think it might just be bad acid reflux... should i just take some extra strength antacids to see if that helps?",
