    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait really? i'm not even that old and i don't have any other issues. it's just a little burning feeling. i've had bad heartburn for years and this feels pretty much the same. it's not like i'm actually having a heart attack or anything, i feel fine when i'm just sitting here. aren't you kind of overreacting? it's probably just my diet.",
